  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25146640",
      "title": "Scoping Component Styles With CSS Modules",
      "lectureOrder": 68,
      "videoOrder": 63,
      "sourceHash": "54df191276e9a74216bd9ac519d7825082a9be7b309e5204ff7c47cec8762207",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.06,
          "end": 5.18,
          "en": "In the first demo application we built,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.18,
          "end": 8.77,
          "en": "I gave you one CSS file that contained the styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.77,
          "end": 11.57,
          "en": "for all components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.57,
          "end": 13.6,
          "en": "That works for a small demo",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.6,
          "end": 17.1,
          "en": "but not necessarily for a bigger project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.1,
          "end": 20.28,
          "en": "There, you typically want to have different CSS files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.28,
          "end": 22.3,
          "en": "for your different components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.3,
          "end": 25.4,
          "en": "and hence, the CSS file which I provided to you here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.4,
          "end": 26.573,
          "en": "is very slim.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.49,
          "end": 30.82,
          "en": "Now, when it comes to styling the different components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.82,
          "end": 34.26,
          "en": "it would be even nicer if the styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.26,
          "end": 37.63,
          "en": "set up in a specific CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.63,
          "end": 42.63,
          "en": "would then be scoped to the component to which they belong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.88,
          "end": 46.24,
          "en": "So it would be nice if next to MainNavigation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.24,
          "end": 48.81,
          "en": "we could add let's say a MainNavigation.css file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.81,
          "end": 51.98,
          "en": "we could add let's say a MainNavigation.css file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.98,
          "end": 55.16,
          "en": "and then define the styles in that file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.16,
          "end": 58.8,
          "en": "that belong to this MainNavigation.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.8,
          "end": 62.78,
          "en": "And they should not affect any other component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.78,
          "end": 64.55,
          "en": "That's something you'll often want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.55,
          "end": 66.65,
          "en": "because in bigger react projects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.65,
          "end": 70.85,
          "en": "you often work with hundreds or thousands of components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.85,
          "end": 71.94,
          "en": "and you want to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.94,
          "end": 74.843,
          "en": "that your styles don't clash with each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.2,
          "end": 79.47,
          "en": "Now the good thing is that Create React App,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.47,
          "end": 82.5,
          "en": "this tool which we use for creating this project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.5,
          "end": 86.62,
          "en": "gives us a project that has a feature built in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.62,
          "end": 90.27,
          "en": "that allows us to scope styles to components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.27,
          "end": 94.5,
          "en": "And that feature is called CSS modules.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.5,
          "end": 97.31,
          "en": "It's a behind-the-scenes code transformation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.31,
          "end": 102.03999999999999,
          "en": "which will make sure that we can attach CSS files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.03999999999999,
          "end": 104.7,
          "en": "to specific components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.7,
          "end": 108.45,
          "en": "For this, we first of all need to name our CSS files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.45,
          "end": 109.57,
          "en": "in a certain way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.57,
          "end": 114.57,
          "en": "We need to make sure that they end with .module.css",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.63,
          "end": 115.49000000000001,
          "en": "So in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.49000000000001,
          "end": 120.45,
          "en": "the file is named MainNavigation.module.css",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.67,
          "end": 123.84,
          "en": "And then in MainNavigation.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.84,
          "end": 128.01,
          "en": "we can import from this CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.01,
          "end": 130.16,
          "en": "That certainly looks strange,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.16,
          "end": 131.36,
          "en": "and it's not something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.36,
          "end": 134.5,
          "en": "that would work in standard JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.5,
          "end": 137.46,
          "en": "but since we have this extra built step here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.46,
          "end": 141.11,
          "en": "which parses and transforms our code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.11,
          "end": 143.32999999999998,
          "en": "before it reaches the browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.32999999999998,
          "end": 146.73,
          "en": "we can actually import from CSS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.73,
          "end": 150.85,
          "en": "And that is what we're already doing in index.js by the way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 150.85,
          "end": 154.32,
          "en": "We're importing a CSS file and behind the scenes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 154.32,
          "end": 158.57,
          "en": "that will tell the build process that this CSS code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 158.57,
          "end": 162.73,
          "en": "should be injected into the loaded page as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 162.73,
          "end": 165.25,
          "en": "We can do the same here in MainNavigation.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 165.25,
          "end": 169.18,
          "en": "but now to attach this styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.18,
          "end": 173.72,
          "en": "or this style file and its classes to this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 173.72,
          "end": 175.558,
          "en": "we don't import just MainNavigation.module.css like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 175.558,
          "end": 179.41,
          "en": "we don't import just MainNavigation.module.css like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 179.41,
          "end": 184.26,
          "en": "but instead we import something, for example, classes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 184.26,
          "end": 187.483,
          "en": "this name is up to you, from this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 188.93,
          "end": 190.28,
          "en": "Now I named it classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 190.28,
          "end": 193.3,
          "en": "because this something here, which we import,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 193.3,
          "end": 196.37,
          "en": "will actually be a JavaScript object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 196.37,
          "end": 198.763,
          "en": "where all the CSS classes you define in this CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 198.763,
          "end": 202.27,
          "en": "where all the CSS classes you define in this CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 202.27,
          "end": 206.16,
          "en": "will be properties of this object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 206.16,
          "end": 209.7,
          "en": "And you can then use them in your JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 209.7,
          "end": 213.19,
          "en": "to attach those classes to your elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 213.19,
          "end": 216.369,
          "en": "and behind the scenes everything will be transformed such",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 216.369,
          "end": 217.202,
          "en": "that those class names are made unique per component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 217.202,
          "end": 222.1,
          "en": "that those class names are made unique per component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 222.1,
          "end": 223.72,
          "en": "So let me give you an example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 223.72,
          "end": 227,
          "en": "We could go to the header JSX element here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 227,
          "end": 229.79,
          "en": "and add the class name prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 229.79,
          "end": 233.55,
          "en": "and set this not to a hard-coded string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 233.55,
          "end": 237.72,
          "en": "but instead to a dynamic value with curly braces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 237.72,
          "end": 241.77,
          "en": "and set it equal to classes.header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 243.49,
          "end": 247.01,
          "en": "Now we can add a class named header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 247.01,
          "end": 250.86,
          "en": "because here I am accessing header on classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 250.86,
          "end": 253.35,
          "en": "to this CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 253.35,
          "end": 256.31,
          "en": "And any styles we define in here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 256.31,
          "end": 260.55,
          "en": "would then only affect this component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 260.55,
          "end": 263.67,
          "en": "So if I save this and I gave this a red color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 263.67,
          "end": 266.14300000000003,
          "en": "you see now that's colored red.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 267.03,
          "end": 271.51,
          "en": "And if I had another header class in another component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 271.51,
          "end": 275.53,
          "en": "it would not be red because the styles are scoped",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 275.53,
          "end": 276.823,
          "en": "as I just explained.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 278.09000000000003,
          "end": 280.83,
          "en": "Now the goal is here not to make this red",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 280.83,
          "end": 284.61,
          "en": "but instead I prepared some other styles for you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 284.61,
          "end": 286.44,
          "en": "which you'll find attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 286.44,
          "end": 290.78,
          "en": "You'll find a MainNavigation.module.css file attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 290.78,
          "end": 293.38,
          "en": "and you can simply replace your MainNavigation.module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 294.645,
          "end": 296.39300000000003,
          "en": "CSS file with mine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 297.45,
          "end": 300.4,
          "en": "Now in here, I defined a bunch of styles for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 300.4,
          "end": 302.94,
          "en": "and therefore, we now just have to wire them up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 302.94,
          "end": 304.32,
          "en": "to the elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 304.32,
          "end": 307.64,
          "en": "We already added the header class to the header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 307.64,
          "end": 310.44,
          "en": "On this div with the logo text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 310.44,
          "end": 315.44,
          "en": "you should add classes.logo and that's actually it already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 316,
          "end": 319.8,
          "en": "And with that, if you save this, let me zoom out a bit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 319.8,
          "end": 324.8,
          "en": "now we got this good looking navigation bar at the top here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 325.13,
          "end": 327.94,
          "en": "By the way, it's not optimized for mobile",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 327.94,
          "end": 330.44,
          "en": "since this is not really a CSS course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 330.44,
          "end": 333.11,
          "en": "but I want to focus on react instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 333.11,
          "end": 336.57,
          "en": "But now with that, we added this nice navigation bar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 336.57,
          "end": 340.93,
          "en": "and we added it such that we have component specific styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 340.93,
          "end": 343.913,
          "en": "which are also scoped to this component.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
